  "body": "\" In all cases, the input event comes before the corresponding change event (if any).\" \nyet\n \"the user agent must queue a task to fire a simple event that bubbles named input at the input element. The corresponding change event, if any, will be fired when the control loses focus.\"\nIn that latter case the input event may be fired after change.\n\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#common-input-element-events\n",
